WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
If he goes to the toilet instead

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,400
There's no way I'd risk going out

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,400
Don't suffer a loss

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,400
let him be

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,400
What's a mere shame?

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,800
Compared to the sense of security in a room

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,000
These are all small things

8
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
Anyway, I'm mentally prepared

9
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:19,550
Arrange it cleanly

10
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:21,750
The water actually became clear

11
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:24,510
I didn’t expect smart toilets to be so magical

12
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:26,510
This wave of resources will definitely be well spent.

13
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,510
Never have to venture out again

14
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:32,320
Indeed magical

15
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,520
Can drain water normally even without sewers

16
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:37,320
But our room is too small and the ventilation is too slow

17
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:38,320
The taste is too big

18
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,120
It smells as bad as your black silk stockings that haven’t been washed for two days
